\pard\f0\fs20\sl222\slmult1\sa30 Software Engineer with 5+ years of software development experience, including 4+ years building Java/Spring Boot backend services for FedNow and TCH RTP real-time payments. Delivers REST APIs, ISO 20022 processing, Kafka event mappings, MongoDB persistence, CI/CD, and security remediation in a regulated financial environment. Built reusable automation that reduced recurring API and database validation time by 67%, from ~30 minutes to ~10 minutes.\b0\par
